window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>What was missing from my life? A crazy cult that worships the ancient god of nightmares, that’s what. </p> <p>When I break my most sacred vow and invade my mom’s dreams, things get complicated, fast. With Valerian’s help, I’m on a quest to boost my powers and learn to forgive myself — all while saving my home world from complete annihilation at the hands of deranged cultists. </p> <p>In other words, a regular Wednesday.</p>"; 
